# adr-lint: the exact code rules, checked as files are written
pre-commit  adr-lint-check  *.rs,*.ts,*.tsx,*.mts,*.cts,*.go,*.py,adr-lint.toml,tsconfig.json,tsconfig.base.json,tsconfig.app.json,tsconfig.node.json,pyproject.toml,go.mod+.adr.yaml  warn  files adr-lint check --
pre-push  adr-lint-candidates  *.rs,*.ts,*.tsx,*.go,*.py+.adr.yaml  warn  adr-lint candidates --base default
pre-push  adr-lint-cli-probe  +adr-lint.toml  warn  heavy adr-lint cli-probe
